+
+5.1 The interim hypothesis
+
+Submitted in the interim checkpoint (B3_interim_checkpoint_v3.md): a monitoring approach that
+separates (1) system health, (2) data and prediction drift, and (3) labeled model performance will do a better job
+of identifying meaningful AI failures than infrastructure checks and per-feature drift tests alone. Feature-level
+drift should trigger investigation rather than automatic retraining unless it also affects model outputs or
+performance.
+The final monitor is a refinement and operationalization of this hypothesis, not a replacement of it.
+
