+10.1 Against the hypothesis
+
+Check                               Result                                Outcome
+                                    OK                                    Matched intended interpretation
+Drift severity on the control S0?   OK / LOW / HIGH / HIGH                Matched in the saved run and in all
+                                                                          tested settings
